        "%s\n\nCPU:        %6.2f%%\nMemory:     %6.2f%%\nGoroutines: %d\nUpdated:    %s\n\npress q to quit\n",
        title,
        m.last.cpuPct,
        m.last.memPct,
        m.last.gorCount,
        m.last.ts.Format(time.TimeOnly),
    )
}

